<section class="py-[120px] max-md:py-20">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="max-w-[680px]">
      <span class="eyebrow">About us</span>
      <h2 class="about-heading mt-4 font-serif">
        Small studio. <em>Intense focus.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-[620px] text-[19px] leading-[1.5] text-ink-2">
        Indigo Foundry exists for the organizations and founders who know what they want but need the right partner to build it — and for those who aren't sure yet, but know something needs to change.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[620px] text-[19px] leading-[1.5] text-ink-2">
        We work side by side with every client — not handing off to a team you've never met, but staying in it with you from first conversation to launch and beyond. The work is better when the vision is shared. That's not a philosophy we talk about — it's how we actually operate.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary mt-8" href="/about">
        More about us
        <svg class="arrow" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14">
          <path d="M3 11 L11 3 M5 3 H11 V9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-heading {
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(44px, 5.6vw, 84px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
